      "date": "2026-01-07T13:21:00.000Z",
      "title": "Flex Foods Ltd. Announces Resignation of Mr. Pankaj S Pattam as Senior Management Personnel , Effective January 7, 2026",
      "body": "Flex Foods Ltd. announced that Mr. Pankaj S Pattam, Vice President - Operations and designated as a Senior Management Personnel of the Company in terms of Regulation 16(1)(d) of Listing Regulations, 2015, has tendered his resignation from the services of the Company due to personal and family reasons. The management has accepted his resignation and consequently, he stands relieved from the services of the Company after the close of office hours on January 7, 2026. The resignation was disclosed under Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, with details provided in Annexure A and the resignation letter in Annexure B. The company follows SEBI regulations for disclosure and governance, ensuring transparency in management changes. The resignati",
